casts the next few hours’ electric loads based on the changing


pattern of load data. STLF is the foundation for micro-


grid “source–grid–load–storage” operation and dispatch [1, 2].


STLF can coordinate ﬂexible energy storage (ES) systems or


advanced demand response (DR) technologies for peak regula-


tion [3]. In addition, STLF can effectively reduce the uncertainty


